IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `snap2-3val`

-- Tests of the helpers, written from the definition of three-valued conjunction, disjunction and negation.
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: both answers hold` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: at least one answer holds` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: at least one answer holds` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: at least one answer holds` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: at least one answer holds` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the answer reversed` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the answer reversed` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the answer reversed` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: every answer in the list holds` (LIST JUST TRUE, JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: every answer in the list holds` (LIST JUST TRUE, NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: every answer in the list holds` (LIST NOTHING, JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: some answer in the list holds` (LIST JUST FALSE, JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: some answer in the list holds` (LIST JUST FALSE, NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: some answer in the list holds` (LIST JUST FALSE, JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the later of two dates` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the later of two dates` (Date 5 1 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the later of two dates` (Date 1 2 2026) (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the lesser of two numbers` 180 90 EQUALS 90
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the lesser of two numbers` 90 180 EQUALS 90
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the higher of two numbers` 7.25 8 EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `s 2015 helper: the higher of two numbers` 9 8 EQUALS 9
